   "title": "Hanwha Systems wins SAR microsatellite constellation project",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261030/hanwha-systems-wins-sar-microsatellite-constellation-project",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
