   "title": "Hyundai Motor advances $6.3 bil. AI hub in Saemangeum",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261030/hyundai-motor-advances-63-bil-ai-hub-in-saemangeum",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
