   "title": "Minerals Commission defends termination of Northern Ashanti Mines’ licences over $8.38m debt",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/minerals-commission-defends-termination-of-northern-ashanti-mines-licences-over-8-38m-debt/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
