   "title": "LS Speaker Om Birla meets counterparts from Cuba, Russia ahead of BRICS parliamentary forum meeting",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/ls-speaker-om-birla-meets-counterparts-from-cuba-russia-ahead-of-brics-parliamentary-forum-meeting/article71623634.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
   "source": "thehindu.com",
   "published": "Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:53:43 +0530",
   "_dt": 1793100223.0,
   "ageDays": 2.93,
   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription Ahead of Cuba’s resolution against the U.S. blockade to be taken up by the UN General Assembly on October 27, the Caribbean nation intensified its diplomatic outreach to the Global South on Sunday (October 25, 2026), with the Vice President of Cuba’s National Assembly of People’s Power and the Council of State Mari Machado meeting Lok Sabha Speaker Om Birla here.",
   "summary_zh": "随着古巴关于应对美国封锁的决议将于10月27日提交联合国大会审议，这个加勒比国家于星期日（2026年10月25日）加强了面向全球南方的外交联络。古巴全国人民权力代表大会副主席兼国务委员会成员玛丽·马查多在这里会见了人民院议长奥姆·比尔拉。订阅即可解锁这些内容。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription Ahead of Cuba’s resolution against the U.S. blockade to be taken up by the UN General Assembly on October 27, the Caribbean nation intensified its diplomatic outreach to the Global South on Sunday (October 25, 2026), with the Vice President of Cuba’s National Assembly of People’s Power and the Council of State Mari Machado meeting Lok Sabha Speaker Om Birla here. Following the meeting with Ms. Machado, Mr. Birla said they had “discussed strengthening parliamentary exchanges, capacity-building and cooperation in healthcare and pharmaceuticals.” Cuba is participating in the BRICS Parliamentary Forum meeting as a partner country of the grouping. This comes two days after Cuba’s ambassador to India Juan Carlos Marsan Aguilera accused the United States of carrying out a naval blockade that has created an acute energy crisis in his country. “Cuba is fully capable of defending itself. The U.S. is practising the Monroe Doctrine in our region,” Mr. Aguilera said, seeking support for Cuba’s UNGA resolution. Mr. Birla also met the Chairman of the State Duma of Russia, Vyacheslav Volodin, on Saturday (October 24), to discuss bilateral ties. India and Russia are marking the 80th anniversary of their bilateral relationship and the two dignitaries carried out a review of parliament-level exchanges between the two countries against the backdrop of unfolding global and regional developments. The Lok Sabha Speaker informed the Russian delegation about the steps taken to make parliamentary proceedings accessible in various Indian languages through Sansad Bhashini. According to a statement issued by the Parliament Secretariat, Mr. Birla highlighted the importance of using technology in making parliamentary functioning more accessible, efficient, and people-centric. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
